      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><h3>Destination Delivery Handover for Two‑Wheeler &amp; Motorcycle</h3>

<p>The handover at the destination is the final checkpoint that guarantees the vehicle reaches the consignee in the exact state documented at pickup. It combines a visual re‑inspection under daylight, a precise odometer cross‑check, and a formal sign‑off that records the condition accepted by the recipient.</p>

